                %li
                  %a{:href => "#HomomorphismsOfSmoothSpaces"} Homomorphisms of smooth sets
                %li
                  %a{:href => "#ProductsAndFiberProductsOfSmoothSpaces"} Products and fiber products of smooth sets
                %li
