              for the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category"} category
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Fr%C3%A9chet+manifolds"} Fréchet manifolds
              and
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+functions"} smooth functions
              between these, which generalizes smooth manifolds to possibly
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/infinite-dimensional+manifold"} infinite-dimensional
              smooth manifolds
            .maruku-equation
